# M26 p8 Bake Ambient Occlusion on a SHARP crease (UE Bake Mesh Attribute Maps, Occlusion evaluator).
# High: Lat Long 128x128, a triangle patch (1 picked + 16 grows) raised by a straight 15 cm Extrude - vertical walls,
# so the foot of the walls is a sharp concave corner. Low: two Lat Long 32x32 at the same place - Sphere2 baked with
# Normal + Ambient Occlusion, Sphere3 with Normal only. Then the high leaves the shot and the two lows stand side by side.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,250,-400
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.5,0.866
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.HorizontalSlices 128
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.VerticalSlices 128
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,60,0
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,110,-170
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,1
Дано run Modeling "Select Elements tool"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: Triangle"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: Grow Selection"
Дано --subject modeling set Element.Distance 15
Дано run Modeling "Mesh operation: Extrude"
Дано run Modeling "Accept: write the edit into the static mesh asset"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.HorizontalSlices 32
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.VerticalSlices 32
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,250,-400
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.5,0.866
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,60,0
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда --subject modeling set Bake.ProjectionDistance 20
Когда --subject modeling set Bake.AmbientOcclusion 1
Когда --subject modeling set Bake.Curvature 0
Когда run Modeling "Bake Normal Map"
Когда run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Когда run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject selection set Translation 0,60,0
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда --subject modeling set Bake.AmbientOcclusion 0
Когда run Modeling "Bake Normal Map"
Когда run Entity Sphere
Когда --subject selection set Translation 0,60,-3000
Когда run Entity Sphere2
Когда --subject selection set Translation -65,60,0
Когда run Entity Sphere3
Когда --subject selection set Translation 65,60,0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,90,-200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,1
Тогда-вид 2_pair_ao two lows: LEFT (Sphere2) baked with AO - the plateau's foot darkened by a band; RIGHT (Sphere3) Normal only - no darkening at the foot
Когда run Panel "Open Logs"
Тогда 2_pair_window the same with the bake log lines (Sphere2: Normal + AO; Sphere3: Normal)
Когда run Open "Textures/Baked/Sphere2_AO.detex"
Тогда 1_ao_png the AO map (Textures/Baked/Sphere2_AO.png beside it): white background, a distinctly dark (<= 0.5) band along the plateau foot
